docs {
  # Categories

  A category classifies a **book** by subject or type (`Philosophy`, `Fiction`). A book may have
  several categories, and a category may be empty. Names are unique per reader among active
  categories, ignoring case, spacing and Unicode composition. **Category presets** are read-only
  suggestions; nothing is created until the reader creates a category explicitly.

  Run the folder in order. **Register categories reader** creates its own disposable account and
  the folder creates its own books, so it is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Categories and collections").
}
